1. Play the game using the daily rotating pool of sect cards. Each round needs to cause maximum damage to the wooden puppet;
2. Each round is limited to 12 turns. After 10 rounds, the cumulative total damage is settled;
3. The final score will enter the ranking list, while the single player mode must reach 2000 or above, and the two player mode must reach 4000 or above;
4. In this mode, all Immortal Fates are invalid, and the breakthrough of phase is automatically carried out;
5. In the two player mode, you can drag the card in your hand to the teammate's Avatar to pass it. It is limited to one time in a turn, and each time it consumes 1 Exchange Card Chance (limited to the same sect card and side job card);
6. You can speed up the battle animation with Heavenly Token. In the two player mode, if either player has the Heavenly Token, both parties can speed it up.
